; [node] holds the private-type definition + hash-consing + smart-constructor
;   normalization: a term's private record can only be built in its defining
;   module, so construction lives here and [Term]/[Context] expose the frozen
;   views. It is [private_modules] so no consumer can reach the raw builders
;   (I2: smart constructors via [Context] are the sole public construction path).
; [iarr_unsafe] holds the optional no-copy [Iarr] cast, private for the same
;   reason (ADR-0003 fixes B1).

(library
